{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S02、S04、S11等段的感受提示偏密，多个意象连续出现，容易让观众来不及消化；个别叙述还加入了原文未明确说明的动机，例如“让对方安心”，不如Y克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键词把每段人物心理的核心抓出来，即使不逐字阅读，也能迅速知道他在想什么、为什么这样做；话与感受交替，又把心理变化和音乐中的具体起伏联系起来。尤其从最初害怕暴露喜欢，到逐渐接受自己的感情，再到承认无法保证永远，前后变化比较容易跟住；感受也不只是泛泛地说悲伤、快乐，而有身体、空间、光线、声音和时间流动的具体层次。Y的双栏排法确实更直观清爽，但右侧短词较容易成为一组组独立的氛围标签，观众能感受到气氛，却不一定能抓住这些感受与人物心理转折之间的关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e0aa1df6-39f0-4997-b907-ebcc90223392", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005132004410Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:52:19.733922+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "667ff4a44cf1692a51bdaa52f583e074c583bc72a5f8c71999768b2d64d3d19e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1ef